                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was a pleasure discussing recent developments in our local startup industry with Donn Rubin of BioSTL. The greater St. Louis region is home to incredible agricultural and healthcare technology companies, and BioSTL has been at the forefront in connecting our community with markets around the globe. \n\nAs co-chair of the Abraham Accords Caucus, I have worked with my colleagues to foster deeper business relationships between Missouri, Israel, and Arab partners in the region that will promote a more stable and prosperous future for all.",
