                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was proud to support today\u2019s One Big Beautiful Bill that prevented the largest tax increase in history, secured our border, stood with our military, and strengthened and reformed Medicaid so it will continue to support the most vulnerable in our society.  \n\nI urge the Senate to work quickly and send the bill to President Trump\u2019s desk for his signature.",
