                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined VA Secretary Doug Collins for an important roundtable meeting with the St. Louis VA Healthcare Director and leadership team. We discussed quality patient care and the John Cochran campus major improvement project. \n\nVA Secretary Collins shared his vision for improving services and healthcare for our nation\u2019s veterans who earned and deserve the very best.\n\nIt was a privilege to spend time with constituents and hear about their military service and experience with the VA.",
