                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "By implementing commonsense protections like work requirements for able-bodied adults and prohibiting illegal immigrants from accessing Medicaid, this historic bill will also strengthen and protect Medicaid for those who need it: expectant mothers, children, seniors, and those with disabilities.",
