                "reply_count": 25,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was great to be at the White House with President Trump and my colleagues celebrating the One, Big, Beautiful Bill!  \n\nI was proud to vote for such transformative legislation that prevents the largest tax hike in American history, secures our border, strengthens Medicaid, supports our military, and ushers in a new Golden Age for America.",
