                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The OBBB will modernize our military to restore American strength after Biden\u2019s weakness triggered conflicts across the globe. \n\nThis not only includes better housing, healthcare, and family assistance for servicemembers, but also the development of state of-the-art military technologies like the F-47 stealth fighter that will be built right here in Missouri.\n\nhttps://t.co/F1a8QNtNiK",
