                "reply_count": 19,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The American people do not support shutting down the government for $1.5 trillion of out-of-touch liberal policies like free healthcare for illegal immigrants. \n\nSenator Chuck Schumer needs to stop trying to appease his far-left, radical base, support the clean bill, and reopen the government.",
